  "description": "Gratia has never known the warm love of family. But one day, she suddenly finds herself surrounded by everything she doesn’t have: riches, nobility, and most of all, a loving family. Before the vision ends, they tell Gratia they love her and will see her soon, but that she must first face hardship. Hearing news of a missing child, a man takes her to Luchiffalo Manor, where she meets the same family from her vision! Is Gratia the lost child of House Luchiffalo, and did she really see the future? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
